# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
dist/
dist-ssr/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local planning notes + recovered-contract dump + pre-canonization docs backup.
# NOTE: `affection_docs/` is NOT ignored — it is the committed source of truth the app
# imports at build time (via import.meta.glob). `docs/` holds the local ARCHITECTURE.md,
# `docs/solidity/` (reference-only, available on GitHub at busytoby/atropa_pulsechain),
# and `docs/affection_docs_working_backup/` (the pre-canonization working KB).
# NOTE: `contracts/artifacts/` is NOT ignored either — the app imports the compiled
# batcher artifacts at build time; recompile with `npm run compile-batcher`.
docs/

